    "detailed_description": "That's the day it all started on Sept. 13. 2020. In the early morning of the same day, I was already standing at the bus station, waiting for my bus. I had to travel a couple of three hundred kilometers to a small town. I found a hotel quickly. It was quite a modern building at first glance.<br />\r\nNot very high at the bottom was normal such sizes of a signboard, on which the trap hotel Veranda, beautiful luminous letters, went inside. Beautiful small reception, pretty girl behind the counter. It was probably not even five minutes before I had already closed my eyes and fallen asleep. That's where it all started.<br />\r\nAs you progress through, you'll need to find keys and open locked rooms. A first-person game with elements of horror. Explore the hotel and its secrets. Collect batteries for your flashlight. Find clues and assemble the whole story into a single picture. The darkness can conceal various mysteries.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nF - flashlight, Tab - inventory<br />\r\nIn-game controls WASD - move, left mouse button - pick up an item. Right mouse button - inspect the item.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- pleasant graphics;<br />\r\n- simple control;<br />\r\n- interesting gameplay",
